# Warp (CR 702.185a) exiles "this creature" - the permanent the warped spell became - at the beginning of the next end step.
# Ephemerate exiles that permanent and returns it: the card comes back as a new object (CR 400.7), which the delayed ability
# no longer finds, so the Emissary stays on the battlefield through the end step and is not offered from exile later. Black
# Lotus's blue pays the warp cost {U/R}, Plains Ephemerate, which waits in exile for its rebound.

